  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-23T19:59:31.164Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to be able to locomote without disrupting the full-body IK. The transition that occurs when the walking animations are triggered is visually jarring. As I'm using a VR treadmill to walk in the game (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j5GRLgXXBnE), my avatar should appear to move naturally as it continues to track my feet. I realise this is not a feature that many would find useful at this time, but I thought I'd ask in case there is a workaround in place that someone could share with me. Thank you.",
